%% OOPLIX V1 — Recovery Roadmap
%% Remediation sequence for the 3 residual CRITICAL gaps and the NOT CERTIFIED audit.
%% All three critical gaps share one root cause: storage models built without an ownership dimension.
flowchart TD
    classDef root    fill:#B00020,stroke:#7A0016,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF,font-weight:bold
    classDef gap     fill:#FBE9EC,stroke:#B00020,stroke-width:2px,color:#0B1F33
    classDef work    fill:#EAF1F8,stroke:#1F4E79,stroke-width:2px,color:#0B1F33
    classDef verify  fill:#E8F3EC,stroke:#0F9D58,stroke-width:2px,color:#0B1F33
    classDef planned fill:#F2F4F6,stroke:#8A96A3,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#4A5C6D

    ROOT["`**ROOT CAUSE**
    Three storage models were built
    before multi-tenancy existed.
    None carries an ownership dimension.`"]:::root

    GA["G1-B15 · CRITICAL<br/>customerSupportEngine.cjs<br/>zero orgId · 190 tickets exposed"]:::gap
    GB["G1-B16 · CRITICAL<br/>5 customer engines<br/>zero orgId · 0 of 123 records owned"]:::gap
    GC["G1-B17 · CRITICAL<br/>no ownership transfer<br/>both guards demand it"]:::gap

    ROOT --> GA & GB & GC

    W1["`**R1.1** Define the ownership contract once
    orgId + accountId, sourced from
    membership-verified req.org — never the raw header`"]:::work
    W2["`**R1.2** Backfill ownership into 3 stores
    190 tickets · 123 customer records · membership rows
    Reversible migration with a dry-run mode`"]:::work
    W3["`**R1.3** Thread orgId through 5 customer engines
    + 2 support services. Filter at the engine
    boundary, not only at the route.`"]:::work
    W4["`**R1.4** Build transferOwnership()
    The single operation both existing guards
    already demand but was never written`"]:::work

    GA --> W1
    GB --> W1
    GC --> W1
    W1 --> W2 --> W3
    W1 --> W4

    V1["`**VERIFY** Two real orgs + unique leak markers
    Every probe returns 403 with 0 rows leaked
    Negative-tested: must fail against un-fixed code`"]:::verify
    W3 --> V1
    W4 --> V1

    A1["`**R2** Accessibility AA remediation
    330 hardcoded white rules · 360 placeholder-only
    inputs · 179 unnamed · 25 of 73 contrast failures`"]:::work
    A2["`**VERIFY** Re-measure rendered DOM
    2 schemes x 5 viewports + WebKit/Gecko
    + screen-reader runtime pass`"]:::verify
    A1 --> A2

    P1["`**R3** API envelope unification
    5 variants to 1 · pagination metadata
    token auth for non-browser clients`"]:::work
    P2["`**VERIFY** Re-score B.7 dimensions
    envelope 5.0 and SDK 5.5 are the two
    lowest scores in the entire portfolio`"]:::verify
    P1 --> P2

    B21["B.21 Compliance & Audit Trail"]:::planned
    B23["B.23 Data Governance"]:::planned
    B25["B.25 Readiness Gate"]:::planned
    B22["B.22 Integrations"]:::planned

    V1 --> B21 & B23
    A2 --> B25
    P2 --> B22
    B21 & B23 & B22 --> B25
